  "limits": [
    "Pure unit/static compatibility only. Final 498 includes 35 independent cases; interim and previous affected-suite counts overlap. Reference vectors and tests are distinct measures.",
    "Synthetic workflow traces use original unit-test doubles, not real provider or database effects. No source/approval/claim/intent writer, adapter/application/HTTP wiring or SQL/grant change.",
    "Retained consistency does not prove authentic origin, authoritative completeness, external original bytes, current owner/MFA or provider state. Off-year commitments do not imply local off-year capture coverage.",
    "The ordinary PR CI run on b7021687 covers the preceding archive/topology batch and excludes this slice. This commit requires later CI; no whole gate or acceptance criterion is closed.",
    "Retained correction/recovery, runtime readers, final held-connection Governance authentication/proof, complete document-byte checks and writer drain/rollback remain dependencies.",
    "A1\u2013A7 and both linked immutable complete gates remain pending. No Archive-owner completion/eligibility exception, production filing, genuine-company admission, outreach, paid action or launch clearance."
  ]
